OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'familiar face' who
OL,4,Adied after bus fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "familiar face" of Liverpool has been
OL,7,Fremembered by his family after he fell
OL,8,Fand died while travelling on a bus.
OL,10,FJohn McGuirk, from Croxteth, spent many
OL,11,Fyears working in pubs across Liverpool
OL,12,Fbefore running a kiosk at the city's
OL,13,FLime Street railway station, his family
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FThe 83-year-old was the only passenger
OL,17,Fon board a bus when he fell at
OL,18,FLiverpool One bus station at about
OL,19,F12:55 BST on 3 October, said Merseyside
OL,20,FPolice.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
