OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'familiar face' who
OL,4,Adied after bus fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe died a week later, said a force
OL,7,Fspokesperson, who added both that the
OL,8,FSerious Collision Investigation Unit
OL,9,Fwas continuing to investigate what had
OL,10,Fhappened and that a 65-year-old man was
OL,11,Fassisting officers.
